# The files the images of the monorepository do not need.
#
# The context of the image of the MCP server is the root of the repository,
# so this file keeps the history of the repository, the build artifacts and
# the local secrets out of the build.
#
# The stacks that build their own image keep their own .dockerignore.

.git
.gitignore

# The build and the coverage artifacts of every module.
**/bin/
**/.coverage/
**/coverage.out

# The local credentials of the databases. They are never committed and they
# never reach an image.
**/.env

# The documentation of the features and the editor noise.
odd/
**/*.md
# The soul of Paca is not documentation: it is the identity of the agent,
# and the image of the agent carries it so the seeding can put it in the
# state of the agent.
!hermes/soul.md
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
